  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">lnfokom st&#xf6;d i Sverige 2014 till En r&#xf6;kfri Generation, NSG. Syftet &#xe4;r att skapa medvetenhet och
engagemang kring villkoren f&#xf6;r tobaksindustrins arbetare, varav m&#xe5;nga &#xe4;r barn samt konsekvenserna i andra delar av v&#xe4;rlden av v&#xe5;r konsumption.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">lnfokom support in Sweden 2014 to A Smoke-Free Generation, NSG. The purpose is to create awareness and
commitment to the conditions of the tobacco industry&apos;s workers, many of whom are children, as well as the consequences in other parts of the world of our consumption.</narrative>
